      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 22 · AI Expense Categorizer\nCategorises expenses/receipts against your chart of accounts, flags policy violations and logs to the expense sheet.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/expense-categorizer` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"employee\": \"Ravi\",\n \"merchant\": \"Taj Hotel Restaurant\",\n \"date\": \"2026-11-03\",\n \"amount\": 9200,\n \"currency\": \"INR\",\n \"people\": 2,\n \"description\": \"client dinner incl. wine\"\n}\n```"
      }
